message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "SR Search Toolkit: Proximity Builder, PICO Strategy Builder, and Search Syntax Converter"
abstract: >-
  A set of three browser-based tools for systematic-review literature searching:
  a Proximity Builder that assembles adjacency/near fragments from synonym stacks,
  a PICO Strategy Builder that generates line-numbered strategies with controlled
  vocabulary mapping, and a Search Syntax Converter that translates a query across
  seven databases/platforms. All tools run entirely in the browser.
type: software
